  "id": "legacy-project-understanding-struts-e2e",
  "title": "Legacy project understanding keeps Struts monolith context focused",
  "description": "Runs the real scanner against a small old Struts Java monolith, then verifies ContextPack selects the requested action and tests without leaking unrelated domains.",
